    "description": "Matsumoto Yushi-Seiyaku Co., Ltd. produces and supplies surface active agents and polymers in Japan, China, Taiwan, Asia, and internationally. It offers spin finishes for extrusion spinning, textile spinning, and functional surface treatment of fibers; sizing chemicals for weaving; knitting and weaving lubricants; scouring agents and detergents; and dyeing and processing auxiliaries, including moisture management, antistatic, water-repellent finishing, anti-soiling, flame-retardants, and anti-light-fastness agents. The company also provides thermo-expandable microcapsules; microbeads; three-dimensional copying systems; anti-tack powder for batch off and inner parting lubricants for bladder-tire parting; modifiers, antistatic agents, anti-fogging agents, and lubricants for plastic materials; emulsifiers, base materials for shampoo and body soaps, fragrance and oil solubilizing agents, and pearl forming agents; chemicals for civil engineering and construction; and chemicals for environment conservation. Its products are used in information and electronics, automobile, precision instruments, civil engineering, construction, rubber, plastics, cosmetics, toiletries, and agriculture industries. The company was founded in 1926 and is headquartered in Yao, Japan."
